{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wish Of Hers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wish of Hers</strong> is a round-based, top-down action roguelike about surviving unstable dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is shaped by the abilities you unlock, the aspects you combine, and the choices you make along the way.<br>Experiment, adapt, and break your own builds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, round-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps that expand as you survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating enemies and constant pressure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185880/extras/11dcdd6c83f12dfee7c9d55c8dee490a.poster.avif?t=1773429654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185880/extras/11dcdd6c83f12dfee7c9d55c8dee490a.webm?t=1773429654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185880/extras/11dcdd6c83f12dfee7c9d55c8dee490a.mp4?t=1773429654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Run</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your set of abilities through <strong>Dream Condensers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify abilities with <strong>Aspects</strong> to create unique synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Reality Shaper</strong> to freely combine up to 4 aspects with an ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run supports different playstyles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185880/extras/29a5c28d86674eb5507dd9cdc795335d.poster.avif?t=1773429654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185880/extras/29a5c28d86674eb5507dd9cdc795335d.webm?t=1773429654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185880/extras/29a5c28d86674eb5507dd9cdc795335d.mp4?t=1773429654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression &amp; Choice</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up during a run to improve core stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited stat slots force meaningful decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges and rewards are influenced by your actions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185880/extras/931122c9a7d0448fcb4b476be9d6b841.poster.avif?t=1773429654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185880/extras/931122c9a7d0448fcb4b476be9d6b841.webm?t=1773429654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185880/extras/931122c9a7d0448fcb4b476be9d6b841.mp4?t=1773429654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current State</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo represents the foundation of Wish of Hers.<br>Early Access will expand the game with new abilities, characters, multi-layer maps, bosses, and run-changing events.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185880/extras/0da7cff068245e3527cd149d3a1b8c6e.avif?t=1773429654\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>"